Let's close our eyes, and pretend there's a boy in front of us....[p]
IH IH IH... Maybe Desmond!!![p]
EH EH, hush now.... Close your eyes and get ready for the first kiss![p]
Wait... Let me moisten my lips![p]
IH IH IH... I'm so embarrassed!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
