[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Don't worry...[p]
But you should be more careful...[p]
If the principal had walked in instead of me....[p]
Or if she had been with me...[p]
Now I wouldn't be able to keep your secret...[p]
And I would have to give you a punishment!!![p]
#SALLY
Oh, no!!!![p]
#TINETTA
Yikes!!![p]
Thank you!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
