How are you fitting into your new role?[p]
I know it's not your dream job....[p]
Also, it's a very hard job....[p]
You are dealing with boys and girls in the prime of their lives....[p]
Definitely the choices you have to make are difficult![p]
It takes a lot of sensitivity, and a strong sense of ethics![p]
#ZACK
(Hmm... Why is she asking me this?)[p]
(Is she just being nice, or did I do something wrong?)[p]
(She didn't find out about when I...?)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
